       "id": "fs-react-q2",
       "type": "single",
       "question_en": "Why are TypeScript types useful in a React project?",
       "question_ar": "لماذا تفيد الأنواع في TypeScript داخل مشروع React؟",
       "options": [
        {
         "id": "a",
         "en": "They catch many mistakes before runtime",
         "ar": "تكشف أخطاء كثيرة قبل التشغيل"
        },
        {
