         "en": "They make every request faster",
         "ar": "تجعل كل طلب أسرع"
        },
        {
         "id": "c",
         "en": "They replace accessibility testing",
         "ar": "تستبدل اختبار الإتاحة"
        }
       ],
       "answer": [
        "a"
